{"unit_id":"XyTT2N2bTc__dsh-aux-vision#feature-1","repo":"XyTT2N2bTc/dsh-aux-vision","commit":"23321d43127c6649247be5a9211fdd7ea112bb04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-aux-vision 的功能「文本主模型图片描述」：用户消息或历史请求含图且当前路由不支持图片时，插件调用视觉模型读取原图，并在发给主模型的请求副本中用描述替换图片块；原会话记录保留原图。。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:198-256"]}
{"unit_id":"XyTT2N2bTc__dsh-aux-vision#feature-2","repo":"XyTT2N2bTc/dsh-aux-vision","commit":"23321d43127c6649247be5a9211fdd7ea112bb04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-aux-vision 的功能「视觉模型候选选择」：按配置的 visionChain 顺序选择可用且声明支持图片的模型；配置链无可用项时可扫描已注册 provider 的模型目录寻找候选。。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:1-80"]}
{"unit_id":"XyTT2N2bTc__dsh-aux-vision#feature-3","repo":"XyTT2N2bTc/dsh-aux-vision","commit":"23321d43127c6649247be5a9211fdd7ea112bb04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-aux-vision 的功能「图片定向追问」：模型调用 vision_ask，指定会话附件 ID 或本地图片路径及问题，插件调用视觉模型针对该问题返回回答。。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:257-317"]}
{"unit_id":"XyTT2N2bTc__dsh-aux-vision#feature-4","repo":"XyTT2N2bTc/dsh-aux-vision","commit":"23321d43127c6649247be5a9211fdd7ea112bb04","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-aux-vision 的功能「描述缓存与失败占位」：图片描述按视觉模型和附件 ID 缓存以复用结果；当候选不可用或调用失败时，可按配置用占位文本替代图片描述。。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:150-195"]}
